lish content in our Directory. Because the Directory Cards component on their page uses an OR operator to pull in content from two tags, they would be unable to add a prefilter condition to look for only English content. This can only be done if the page is using an AND operator. Thus, this tag will be autoapplied to all content that meets the current prefilter conditions. At that point, the page owners can use the AND operator to display content with this tag and GLOBAL#language#english.\u003c/p\u003e\n","dateCreated":"2023-04-26T20:23:44+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-04-26T20:23:44+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#category#migration-transfer","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#category","name":"Migration \u0026 Transfer","description":"Migration \u0026 Transfer","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:32:12+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-12T02:01:29+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#category#business-resilience","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#category","name":"Business Resilience","description":"\u003cp\u003eIn business, resilience means dealing with adversity and shocks, and continuously adapting for growth.\u003c/p\u003e\n","dateCreated":"2023-07-14T01:01:43+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-07-14T01:01:43+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#business-outcome#security","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#business-outcome","name":"security","description":"Security","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:39:09+0000","dateUpdated":"2019-07-22T18:39:09+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#category#security-identity-compliance","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#category","name":"Security, Identity, \u0026 Compliance","description":"Security, Identity, \u0026 Compliance","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:32:22+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-15T04:54:50+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#recon#auto-campaign","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#recon","name":"auto-campaign","description":"\u003cp\u003eauto-campaign\