-sirio-libanes-case-study","dateCreated":"2024-08-15T21:35:25+0000","dateUpdated":"2024-08-15T21:43:38+0000","additionalFields":{"descriptionSummary":"Encompassing an expansive area of approximately 1,076,391 square feet in the heart of São Paulo, Brazil, alongside a cutting-edge healthcare facility in Brasília, the Sírio-Libanês Hospital is a hub offering over 60 specialized medical fields and a capacity exceeding 500 hospital beds. Bridging a multidisciplinary clinical team with state-of-the-art technologies, the hospital has consistently achieved pioneering milestones.","featured":"0","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/customer-references-case-studies-logos/hospital-sirio-libanes%402x.d48972885f39f72ec6a6500927dc8dec85524046.png","displayLocation":"Brazil","customerNameLower":"hospital sírio libanes","footerInfoText":"Published Date","industry":"Healthcare","sortDate":"2023-01-01","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/hospital-sirio-libanes-case-study/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"Hospital Sírio Libanes","publishedDate":"2023","enableShare":"1","headline":"Sírio-Libanês Hospital Revolutionizes its Cloud Financial Management in 5 Months","contentType":"Customer Story"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#product#organizations","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"AWS Organizations","description":"AWS Organizations","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:04:43+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:53+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#language#english","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#language","name":"English","description":"English","dateCreated":"2020-03-03T06:40:42+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:23+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#category#compute","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#category","name":"Compute","description":"Compute","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:31:28+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-12T02:01:30+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#vpc","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#pr